ics in a lot  of ways and one thing that I should say  and I think any honest person should say  is that if we all emerge from this  situation with the same convictions that  we've had before it  were just not thinking and so this has  prompted new thinking on my part I'm  sure it has on yours but we need to  maybe move out of all of our respective  ideological boxes because what just  happened was 1929 things have changed  and if you're thinking does it adapt you  have you have problems of your own in  addition to the problems of the world  okay well I appreciate you coming on not  that you really had anywhere else to go  I know it's so easy to get guests these  days hey are you available am i  available of course everyone's available  but you're always a great guest I thank  you I'll see you in the studio soon I  hope thanks they'll be well  you

